# Tests

Tests use `unittest.TestCase` and `unittest.mock`. Session tests patch miner I/O with `patched_io` in `test_autotune.py`; `FakeMiner` and `run_session` in `test_autotune_session_paths.py` script a miner and can stop a session at the wait after a given status or log line. Upgrade tests in `test_upgrade.py` load config.json as each older version saved it. Leave the network and live miners out of tests.

```python
# BAD
import pytest

def test_live_board():
    requests.get("http://192.168.1.10/api/system/info")

# GOOD
class DecisionTests(unittest.TestCase):
    def test_overheat_steps_frequency_down(self):
        frequency, voltage, reason = autotune.decide_adjustment(**_limits(temp=75))
        self.assertLess(frequency, 700)
```
